## Debugging Steps

### 1. Add Logging to Track Buffer Creation

```java
@Aspect
@Component
public class BufferMonitoringAspect {
    
    private static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(BufferMonitoringAspect.class);
    
    @Around("execution(* org.springframework..*.*(..))")
    public Object monitorBuffers(ProceedingJoinPoint pjp) throws Throwable {
        Object result = pjp.proceed();
        
        if (result instanceof byte[]) {
            byte[] array = (byte[]) result;
            if (array.length > 1_000_000) { // > 1MB
                log.warn("Large byte array created: {} bytes at {}", 
                    array.length, pjp.getSignature());
                Thread.dumpStack(); // See where it's coming from
            }
        }
        return result;
    }
}
```

